            "detailed_description": "Exocomets is a basic yet difficult action game where you try to survive as long as possible against incoming waves of comets.  <br />\r\n<br />\r\nOne hit, and your ship is dead.  <br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou have a simple task: survive for 100 seconds.<br />\r\nTo do this, you must unlock and utilize various powerups.<br />\r\nAlong with powerups, stars can be found floating across the universe.  Be sure to pick them up to give your powerups a boost!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAs you go deeper into the universe throughout levels, more powerups will help you, but more comets will appear, and faster.<br />\r\nGood luck trying to beat the game!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMusic by Ethan &quot;ethanpiedude&quot; Pesikoff, Mark &quot;marchimedes&quot; Trautner, Andy &quot;KeyboardFire&quot; Tockman, and Matthew &quot;matthewpipie&quot; Giordano.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nLike our facebook! https://www.facebook.com/ExocometsGame<br />\r\nFollow our twitter! https://twitter.com/ExocometsGame",
